      "content": "okay but like i checked my temp and i dont think i have a fever. it's just a little line and i feel a bit off. honestly if i just dose myself with some leftover amoxicillin from my last sinus infection will that kill it? i have a whole bottle left over so i could just take a few pills now and see if the red line fades by morning. would that work instead of going to the doctor?",
